---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = 'Библиотека IELTS Practice — Tayanch';
const description = 'Практические IELTS mock-материалы для Listening, Reading и Writing.';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;

const alternates = [{ lang: 'uz', href: base + 'ru/ielts-practice/index/' }, { lang: 'ru', href: base + 'ru/ielts-practice/index/' }, { lang: 'en', href: base + 'en/ielts-practice/index/' }];---

<Base title={title} description={description} lang="ru" localeAlternates={alternates}>
  <section class="library-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="ipr.eyebrow">IELTS PRACTICE KUTUBXONASI</p>
    <h1 data-i18n="ipr.h1">Mock testlar bilan amaliy mashq</h1>
    <p>Bu yerda saralangan Listening, Reading va Writing practice materiallari bitta joyda jamlanadi. Har bir mock alohida sahifada ochiladi.</p>
    <a class="back-link" href={base + 'kurslar/#ielts-courses'}>← IELTS kurslariga qaytish</a>
  </section>

  <section class="mock-grid" aria-label="IELTS mock testlar">
    <article class="mock-card">
      <div class="mock-number">MOCK 001</div>
      <span class="status">Yangi</span>
      <h2>CDI Full Mock</h2>
      <p>Listening, Reading va Writing bo‘limlarini o‘z ichiga olgan to‘liq practice mock. Ichida taymer, savol navigatori, answer key va Writing word count bor.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Listening: 40 savol</li>
        <li>Reading: 40 savol</li>
        <li>Writing: Task 1 va Task 2</li>
      </ul>
      <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-001/index.html'}>Mockni ochish →</a>
      <p class="audio-note">Listening audio fayllari shu mock uchun alohida tayyorlanmoqda.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="mock-card">
      <div class="mock-number">MOCK 004</div>
      <span class="status status-progress">Test bo‘limlari tayyor</span>
      <h2>CDI Full Mock</h2>
      <p>Mockning Reading, Listening va Writing bo‘limlari kutubxonaga qo‘shildi. Har bir bo‘lim alohida ochiladi; Listening audiolari navbatdagi bosqichda ulanadi.</p>
      <div class="mock-actions" aria-label="Mock 004 bo‘limlari">
        <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-004/reading.html'}>Reading</a>
        <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-004/listening.html'}>Listening</a>
        <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-004/writing.html'}>Writing</a>
      </div>
      <p class="audio-note">Audio 1–4 yuklanmoqda — ulanganidan keyin Mock 004 “to‘liq” holatiga o‘tadi.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="mock-card">
      <div class="mock-number">MOCK 002</div>
      <span class="status">Yangi</span>
      <h2>CDI Writing</h2>
      <p>Writing Task 1 va Task 2 uchun alohida practice sahifasi. Javoblarni tekshirish imkoniyati bor.</p>
      <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-002/index.html'}>Mockni ochish →</a>
    </article>

    <article class="mock-card">
      <div class="mock-number">MOCK 003</div>
      <span class="status">Yangi</span>
      <h2>CDI Listening</h2>
      <p>Listening bo'limi uchun to'liq practice test (4 qism, 40 savol). Savol navigatori va answer key bor.</p>
      <a class="open-mock" href={base + 'ielts-mocks/mock-003/index.html'}>Mockni ochish →</a>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="library-note">
    <h2>Materiallar tartibi</h2>
    <p>Yangi testlar avval tekshiriladi, keyin skill va format bo‘yicha kutubxonaga qo‘shiladi. Dublikat materiallar qayta joylanmaydi.</p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .library-hero { max-width:760px; padding:3.5rem 0 1.5rem; }
    .library-hero h1 { margin:.4rem 0 .8rem; font:800 clamp(2.25rem,5vw,3.6rem)/1.07 var(--font-display); letter-spacing:-.04em; }
    .library-hero p:not(.eyebrow) { color:var(--muted); font-size:1.08rem; max-width:680px; }
    .back-link { display:inline-flex; margin-top:1rem; color:var(--accent); font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; }
    .mock-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr)); gap:1rem; margin:1.5rem 0 3rem; }
    .mock-card { position:relative; overflow:hidden; padding:1.6rem; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:18px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 14%,var(--surface)),var(--surface)); box-shadow:var(--shadow); }
    .mock-number { color:var(--accent); font:800 .78rem var(--font-display); letter-spacing:.1em; }
    .status { position:absolute; top:1.4rem; right:1.4rem; padding:.3rem .65rem; border-radius:999px; background:#34d399; color:#062b1a; font:800 .72rem var(--font-display); }
    .status-progress { background:#fbbf24; color:#422006; }
    .mock-card h2 { margin:.5rem 0; font:800 1.65rem var(--font-display); }
    .mock-card p,.mock-card li { color:var(--muted); }
    .mock-card ul { margin:1rem 0 1.35rem; padding-left:1.2rem; }
    .open-mock { display:inline-flex; padding:.75rem 1.05rem; border-radius:10px; background: var(--btn-bg); color:#fff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:800; }
    .mock-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:.55rem; margin-top:1.25rem; }
    .mock-actions .open-mock { font-size:.9rem; padding:.65rem .85rem; }
    .audio-note { margin:1rem 0 0; font-size:.88rem; }
    .library-note { border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-top:1.5rem; max-width:720px; }
    .library-note h2 { margin:0 0 .4rem; }
    .library-note p { color:var(--muted); }
  </style>
</Base>
